1 NAME Carl Carlsson /Lundius/
2 GIVN Carl Carlsson
2 _MARNM Lundius
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 8 APR 1638
2 ADDR
3 CITY Jönköping
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 FEB 1715
2 ADDR
