1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 JAN 1826
2 PLAC Uddarp, Skepparslöv, Kristianstad, Sweden
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 FEB 1889
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BURI
