2 CONT
2 CONT Relation between Sven Zethelius Melkerson and Paula Modersohn-Becker, the famous expressionist German painter, is as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT   Sven Zethelius Melkerson is Paula Modersohn-Becker's husband's wife's sister's husband's wife's aunt's husband's niece's husband's great uncle's wife's nephew's wife's nephew. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paula_Modersohn-Becker
2 CONT
