1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lagerbjelke_nr_115#TAB_4 Adelsvapen]
2 CONT * [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/Sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=10843 Riksarkivet SBL]
2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustaf_Lagerbjelke
2 CONT
2 CONT Count Gustaf Lagerbjelke RoKKMO (6 October 1817 – 6 March 1895). The 3rd Count Lagerbjelke was a Swedish politician, the last Lord Marshal and the first Speaker of Första kammaren of the Riksdag.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Gustaf Lagerbjelke was born 6 October 1817 on Skeppsholmen, Stockholm, to colonel Axel Lagerbjelke, 2nd Count Lagerbjelke and baroness Carolina Antoinetta Cederström.[2] After his father's death in 1832, he became 3rd Count Lagerb
2 CONC jelke.[2] Lagerbjelke studied at Uppsala University, where he became Juris utriusque kandidat in December 1838.[2] Between 1844 and 1866, he served in the Riksdag of the Estates for the Lagerbjelke family.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Along with Henning Hamilton, Gillis Bildt and Eric Josias Sparre [sv], Lagerbjelke became one of the leaders of the Junker Party and was the party's authority on constitutional and formal issues. In connection with the representat
2 CONC ion reform as the country moved to a parliamentary system, he submitted his own proposal, but it was not adopted.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1867, he was a member of Första kammaren of the Riksdag and its speaker from 1867–1876 and 1881–1891.[2] From 27 April 1858 to 31 December 1888, he was Governor of Södermanland County. Lagerbjelke died on 6 March 1895 in Brän
2 CONC nkyrka parish in Stockholm.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal life
2 CONT Lagerbjelke married countess Sofia Albertina Snoilsky, daughter of commander count Gustaf Snoilsky and Ulrika Juliana Lode, in Stockholm on 5 December 1843.[2] After her death in 1847, he married Ebba Augusta Henriette Ribbing, da
2 CONC ughter of rittmeister Bengt Ribbing and Augusta Christina Schmiterlöw, on 19 July 1859 on Liljeholmen in Jönköping.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://minerva.riddarhuset.se/foremal/lagerbjelke-portratt-riddarhusportratt-24172/
