2 CONT * Son of Anders Andersson Appelbom and Anna Behmer
2 CONT * Birth:	1669 in Söderby, Stockholm, Sweden
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000012724175747?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000218639945838 '''Death Record''': September 14, 1730 in Örebro, Örebro Nikolai Sweden]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Appelbom_nr_325#TAB_3 Noble Family Appelbom no. 325]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Harald Appelbom (son of Anders Appelbom, table 4 ).''' Born in 1669 in Söderby. Court lieutenant 1696. Deputy lawman in Närke. Died 1730-09-14 in Örebro. '''Married in 1703 to his step-grandmother's niece Barbara Magdalena Ehre
2 CONC nhielm, daughter of audit secretary Johan Salonius, ennobled Ehrenhielm and Magdalena Gyldenbring.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Magdalena Catharina,''' born 1705-08-07 in Örebro, died in Örebro 1729-05-14.
2 CONT * '''Anders,''' born 1707-03-05 in Örebro, died in Örebro 1712-02-01. I can’t find his death record in Örebro on 1712-02-01. 
2 CONT * '''Johanna Catharina,''' born 1708-07-10 in Örebro, died in Örebro 1709-05-12.
2 CONT * '''Anna Charlotta,''' born 1710-07-03 in Örebro, died 1763-07-04 at Sjöberg. Married 1740-12-23 to her cousin, the district chief Johan Ehrenhielm .
2 CONT * '''Harald,''' born 1711. Chancellery Council. Died 1783. 
2 CONT * '''Johan,''' born 1713-05-17 in Örebro. Died in Uppsala in 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
