1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Af_Bjerk%C3%A9n_nr_1995#TAB_6
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pehr_af_Bjerk%C3%A9n_%281731-1774%29 Pehr af Bjerkén]''' was a broadly merited and distinguished doctor, particularly known for his secret prescription to successfully treat “kräftsjukdomar”, ¹ — a
2 CONC n expert, recognizing all sorts of unscrupulous venereal ulcers and bladder blisters.
2 CONT
2 CONT As a curiosity, and among several other methods and cures, one referral in the notes went out to a particular ancient procedure where toads were to be utilized to suck out the poison from the patients open blisters and wounds. Peh
2 CONC r had received word through the archiater Peter von Heidenstam—relayed by the Queen dowager herself—about the said method, urging him on to put it to the test. Cautiously, he wrote [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carl_Linnaeus Carl 
2 CONC von Linné], asking for advice given the considerable risk of poison already being present within the toads secretions. Carl promptly responded with a recommendation to commence the trials.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1749 Student, Uppsala
2 CONT * 1753 Fil. kand.
2 CONT * 1757 Disp. ''Morbi Expeditionis Classicæ MDCCLVI,'' præsidium [http://www.geni.com/people/Carl-von-Linn%C3%A9/6000000006830161082 C. von Linné]
2 CONT * 1757 Disp. ''Theses medicse,'' præsidium S. Aurivillius
2 CONT * 1757 Med. doc. Universitas Upsaliensis
2 CONT * 1756 Expedition medicus “svenska eskadern till Nordsjön”
2 CONT * 1757 Member, Collegium medicum
2 CONT * 1758 Oxford, Cambridge & London Hospital
2 CONT * 1762 Stadsphysicus, Stockholm
2 CONT * 1762 oo Johanna Margareta Christjernin
2 CONT * 1764 Med. doc. Norrmalms brunn
2 CONT * 1771 Assessor, Collegium medicum
2 CONT * 1772 Med. doc. Tullstaten
2 CONT * 1773 Knighted under his brothers exped.
2 CONT
