1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''He was mayor''' of Halmstad and director of the Louis De Geer founded the African Company. He died as a prisoner of the Company by the Dutch conquered colony Cabo Corso, Swedish Gold Coast (Cape Coast, Ghana). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He was married''' with a daughter of merchant [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_der_Linde_nr_179#TAB_2 Erik Larsson von der Linde], thus brother-Lorentz von der Linde, who was one of Charles X Gustav most intimate frien
2 CONC ds and the youth who was elevated to baronial position in 1653. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Neuman was the''' brother of Daniel Kröger (?).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Another wife''', Sofia Döms?
